* NGSPICE Behavioral Model for ADA4522-1 (Zero-Drift Op-Amp)
* Pin Order: IN+ IN- V+ V- OUT

.SUBCKT ADA4522_BEHAVIORAL INP INN VCC VEE OUT

* 1. High Input Impedance
RIN INP INN 10Gig

* 2. High Open-Loop Gain (130dB) with 2.7MHz Gain Bandwidth Product (GBW)
* Dominant pole at ~1Hz
E1 INT 0 VALUE = { (V(INP) - V(INN)) * 3.16Meg }
R1 INT MID 1k
C1 MID 0 159n

* 3. Voltage Follower / Output Driver with Rail-to-Rail Output Limiting
E_OUT OUT_RAW 0 MID 0 1.0
E_HI HI_LIMIT 0 VALUE = { V(VCC) - 0.05V }
E_LO LO_LIMIT 0 VALUE = { V(VEE) + 0.05V }

* Output bounded within supply rails
E_FINAL OUT 0 VALUE = { MIN( MAX( V(OUT_RAW), V(LO_LIMIT) ), V(HI_LIMIT) ) }

.ENDS ADA4522_BEHAVIORAL
